($t$Acorus calamus$t$, $t$Acorus calamus$t$, $t$Araceae$t$, $t$Famiglia botanica: Araceae. Portamento: Perennial. Altezza massima indicativa: 1 m. Bloom Color: Green. Main Bloom Time: Mid summer. Form: Spreading or horizontal, Upright or erect.$t$, $j${"luce": "Pieno sole", "acqua": "Pianta acquatica/palustre", "terreno": "Tollera terreno: sabbioso/leggero, medio, argilloso/pesante"}$j$::jsonb, ARRAY[$t$Scheda in bozza, importata automaticamente da Plants For A Future (pfaf.org): dati non verificati manualmente, da controllare prima di considerarli affidabili$t$, $t$Nome comune (inglese, fonte PFAF): Sweet Flag - Calamus$t$, $t$Rischi segnalati dalla fonte (testo originale in inglese, non tradotto per non alterarne il significato): The fresh root can be poisonous[7]. When using the plant medicinally, the isolated essential oil should not be used[165]. The essential oil in the roots of some populations of this plant contains the compound asarone. This has tranquillising and antibiotic activity, but is also potentially toxic and carcinogenic[218, 238]. It seems that these compounds are found in the triploid form of the species (found in Asia) whilst the diploid form (found in N. America and Siberia) is free of the compounds[218, 238]. However, the root (but not the isolated essential oil) has been used in India for thousands of years without reports of cancer which suggests that using the whole herb is completely safe, though more research is needed[254]. Only roots free from or with a low content of beta asarone should be used in human herb therapy. Should be avoided in patients taking monoamine oxidase inhibitor antidepressants as possible side-effects [301].$t$], $j${"irrigazione": {"primavera": null, "estate": null, "autunno": null, "inverno": null}, "concimazione": {"primavera": null, "estate": null, "autunno": null, "inverno": null}, "potatura": {"primavera": null, "estate": null, "autunno": null, "inverno": null}, "npk": {"primavera": null, "estate": null, "autunno": null, "inverno": null}}$j$::jsonb, $j${"famiglia_botanica": "Araceae", "giorni_germinazione": null, "giorni_trapianto": null, "giorni_raccolta": null, "finestra_semina": [], "finestra_trapianto": [], "resistenza_gelo": "alta", "spaziatura_cm": null, "consociazioni_favorevoli": [], "consociazioni_sfavorevoli": []}$j$::jsonb, $j${"adatta": null, "dimensione_minima_litri": null, "rinvaso_ogni_mesi": null, "irrigazione_fattore": null}$j$::jsonb, $t$perenne$t$, $t$acorus-calamus$t$, ARRAY[$t$Plants For A Future (pfaf.org) — importazione bozza automatica, dati non verificati manualmente$t$], $t$bozza$t$, null, null),
